# The checked-in parks (docs/design/PREBUILT-PARKS.md, "Checked in"). Each park
# file is one ~135 KB line of solver output: a textual diff of it says nothing,
# and a textual merge of two solves would be neither park — so git treats them
# as whole files (a conflict leaves yours intact and parseable; take main's with
# `git checkout origin/main -- parks/` and run `pnpm run build:parks`). The
# manifest is one seed per line and merges like any text.
parks/*.json linguist-generated=true -diff -merge
parks/manifest.json linguist-generated=true diff merge
